; 3-Color Flower Spirograph — Food Printing G-code
; Rose curve (rhodonea) flower pattern
; Multi-material: 3 syringe colors per layer
;
; Material A: Cream Cheese + blue dye (teal) (outer petals, scale 100%)
; Material B: Cream Cheese + beet powder (pink) (inner petals, scale 60%)
; Material C: Cream Cheese + ube extract (purple) (center circle)
;
; Pattern: 5-petal rose curve r = a·cos(5θ)
; Outer petal diameter: ~52mm
; Inner petal diameter: ~31mm
; Center circle diameter: ~10mm
; Inner petals rotated 36° to interleave
;
; Layers: 3
; Elements per layer: 3 (outer petals + inner petals + center)
; Layer height: 2.0mm
; Total height: 10.0mm
; Twist per layer: 12.0° (total: 24.0°)
; Print speed: 300 mm/min
; Center: (100, 100)

; === INITIALIZATION ===
G21              ; Set units to millimeters
G90              ; Absolute positioning
M82              ; Absolute extrusion mode
G28              ; Home all axes


